Before generating or editing any visual component, read `DESIGN.md` at the project root.

Rules:
- Use ONLY colors, typography, spacing, and radius tokens defined in DESIGN.md
- Follow component patterns from the Components section
- Respect Do's and Don'ts — no neon gradients or generic AI slop
- Marketing pages: Opero-inspired enterprise clarity + restrained agentic telemetry
- Console pages: calm dark operational density per `.better-react-web-ui.md`
- When in doubt, reference DESIGN.md — do not invent new visual values
